[00:25.74]We’re gathered together, Jehovah our God,
[00:31.84]Accepting your warm invitation.
[00:38.80]Your Word is a lamp that lights up our pathway,
[00:45.20]The source of divine education.
[00:52.73](Chorus)
[00:52.88]Teach me your ways, and make me understand;
[00:59.22]Incline my ear to hear your wise command.
[01:06.50]Cause me to walk in ways of truth and right,
[01:12.06]And make your law my principal delight.
[01:44.68]Unreachably high is your wisdom, O God;
[01:50.80]Your judgments we find reassuring.
[01:57.26]Your Word is a source of unending wonder;
[02:03.65]Your sayings of truth are enduring.
[02:10.41](Chorus)
[02:10.56]Teach me your ways, and make me understand;
[02:16.58]Incline my ear to hear your wise command.
[02:23.46]Cause me to walk in ways of truth and right,
[02:29.98]And make your law my principal delight.
